  style RA fill:#10B981,color:#fff
  style DRA fill:#10B981,color:#fff
  style TA fill:#3B82F6,color:#fff
  style CR fill:#3B82F6,color:#fff
  style UR fill:#3B82F6,color:#fff
```

**Execution Flow**:

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
