  p_Description_f9ae1ed3 := 'Validate and durably persist a dependency-ordered task graph, returning as soon as it is safe. Does NOT wait for execution: the durable dispatcher runs the graph independently, so a submitted graph outlives the submitting request, agent run, and server. Producer-agnostic — an agent, deterministic code, or a UI can all submit. Implemented by TaskGraphSubmitOperation in @memberjunction/task-graph.';
